                  "fill": "$text-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Q01　今日決めないといけませんか？",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Qz0uE",
                  "name": "FAQA_0",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "解決策の選択肢や改善見込み額は、時間とともに変わっていく可能性があります。個別現状分析会は毎月の席数に限りがあるため、お早めのご相談をおすすめします。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.8,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "rDgxy",
              "name": "FAQItem_1",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "fill": "$bg-gray",
              "cornerRadius": 4,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 10,
              "padding": 28,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "TgBrW",
                  "name": "FAQQ_1",
                  "fill": "$text-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Q02　パートナーに相談してから決めたいです",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "vaycv",
                  "name": "FAQA_1",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "A　パートナーも同じ悩みを抱えているのであれば、まずはご自身の悩みを優先して解消することをおすすめします。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.8,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "b4pmy",
              "name": "FAQItem_2",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "fill": "$bg-gray",
              "cornerRadius": 4,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 10,
              "padding": 28,
              "children": [
