                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Q10　対面勉強会に参加しないと相談できませんか？",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "djG9r",
                  "name": "FAQA_9",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "A　参加は任意です。遠方の方などはオンラインでの個別相談にも対応しています。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.8,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "w9yf4x",
              "name": "FAQItem_10",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "fill": "$bg-gray",
              "cornerRadius": 4,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 10,
              "padding": 28,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "SzC7b",
                  "name": "FAQQ_10",
                  "fill": "$text-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Q11　全国どこからでも相談できますか？",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "nqMcx",
                  "name": "FAQA_10",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "A　対面勉強会・面談は東京・大阪で定期開催していますが、それ以外の地域の方にはオンラインでご対応しています。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.8,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "Q8DsOo",
              "name": "FAQItem_11",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "fill": "$bg-gray",
              "cornerRadius": 4,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 10,
              "padding": 28,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "SGjGs",
                  "name": "FAQQ_11",
                  "fill": "$text-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Q12　分割払いはできますか？",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Ip7cE",
                  "name": "FAQA_11",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "A　最大24回の分割払いが可能です（弊社の分割手数料はゼロ、カード会社手数料は別途）。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.8,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "K5jY3",
              "name": "FAQItem_12",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "fill": "$bg-gray",
              "cornerRadius": 4,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 10,
              "padding": 28,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "X5hEND",
                  "name": "FAQQ_12",
                  "fill": "$text-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Q13　経営者や相続の相談もできますか？",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "YMgQr",
                  "name": "FAQA_12",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "A　経営者の方・相続に関するご相談には専用プランでご案内しています（詳しくは料金プランをご覧ください）。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.8,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "wTC9y",
              "name": "FAQItem_13",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "fill": "$bg-gray",
              "cornerRadius": 4,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 10,
              "padding": 28,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "zLa9m",
                  "name": "FAQQ_13",
                  "fill": "$text-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Q14　全額返金保証の対象外になるケースはありますか？",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "wWGMG",
                  "name": "FAQA_13",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "A　打合せキャンセルの多発や、ご提案した解決策の実行アクションがない等、適切なご協力が得られない場合は対象外となることがあります。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.8,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "Z0eHi",
              "name": "FAQItem_14",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "fill": "$bg-gray",
              "cornerRadius": 4,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 10,
              "padding": 28,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "qbik3",
                  "name": "FAQQ_14",
                  "fill": "$text-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Q15　運営会社を教えてください",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "bE2RF",
                  "name": "FAQA_14",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "A　一般社団法人 確定拠出年金診断協会／株式会社visibleが運営しています。所在地は東京都千代田区九段南1-5-6 りそな九段ビル5F です。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.8,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
